# Build context for deployment/grid/Dockerfile, whose context is the repository root.
#
# Allowlist: send only what the Dockerfile COPYs. Without this file every build shipped the whole
# repository -- node_modules, the Python venv, the published agent binaries -- and a large file
# changing during the transfer failed the build with "short read ... unexpected EOF".
*

!grid/requirements.txt
!grid/src/
!grid/alembic/
!grid/alembic.ini
!grid/scripts/

# Invented demo rows have no place in a GRID image: the script also refuses to run outside
# GRID_ENVIRONMENT=development, this keeps it off the image altogether.
grid/scripts/seed_demo_data.py

**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
